@title Single-line diagram: drawing, sheets and schedule
@area Reports
# Open a small distribution board, find the single-line diagram by its plain name, look at the drawing and the schedule.
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text single line
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot single-line-diagram
check_blank single-line-diagram
check_layout
click_text Schedule #1
wait 10
shot single-line-schedule
check_layout
